      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-10-20_WidnesExaminer_art0014" n="art0014">
        <head>WORD TO LADIES.</head>
        <p>A WORD TO LADIES.</p>
        <p>Said two stamps for our new and original 111 Booklet. containing plain and practical advice how Ir ties. Suppressions, &amp;c., may be prevented or ren simple means in a few hours. 'Recommended by Physicisns, and thousands of Ladies, as being Genuine Remedy. This is not a quack medicine. Esl 30 years, LESLIE NABTYN, Ltd„ Chemists, 34, Dale OOP..</p>
