      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-10-20_WidnesExaminer_art0048" n="art0048">
        <head>GOSPEL HALL.</head>
        <p>GOSPEL HALL.</p>
        <p>On Sunday, Mr. A. Cope, of Liverpool, spoke to those who were saved and thes t who ware not saved stating that the doctrine of the common fatherhood of God was of Satanic origin,as God is only the Father of those who have been born again, begotten by the Word of God ; if this experience has not been yours you are yet in your sins, a child of wrath, you might know all about the Lord Jesus and the Gospel but unless you take the place as the guilty one before GA and accept Christ as your substitute, the one who died instead of you who de- served to die, you will never be saved. You cannot help being a sinner, you were born in din, but you can help yourself from remaining a sinner under condemned tion, you are in need of a Saviour and that is Christ. Accedt him and you will be saved and become a saint. God always calls those saints whom He saves, therefore it is not presumptive to believe God's Word.</p>
      </div>
