        <head>BOOTS CASII CIIIIEMISTS.</head>
        <p>BOOTS CASII CIIIIEMISTS.</p>
        <p>A.RE SOLE LOCAL AGENTS FOR THE FOLLOWING SPECIALITIES : BAIRD'S BILIOUS AM) LIVER PILLS. Highly recommended to sufferers from Bilious- ness and Liver troubles. is lid. foe Sid. at Boots, Cash Chemists. GRATTON'S EMBROCATION, Splendid testimonials from leading athletes. Strengthens the muscles. Is. for NO. at Boots, Cash Chemists. WILLS' WAUK gEZDIJ'. A real corn curer. It never fails to give prompt relief. is. for 10d. at B-,ots, Cash Chemists. CAMPBELL'S CHERRY COUGH CURE. Unfailing remedy for stubborn coughs and sore throats. is. lid. for is. at Boots, Cash Chemists.</p>
