, Neuralgia, Low Spirits, and all kinds of Weakness. It has often proved v-ry beneficial to persons suffering from great Weakness, ei her after an illness, long confinement to ill-ventilated rooms, or any other cause. It etrikea at the source of the Disease, removing the cause of the illness, and strengthens those parts of the system which have been weakened be it, and therefore most liable ti colds and other ailments, Gwilym Evans' Q sinine Bitters being purely vegetable, it is a Natural Tonic,and suited to all ages at all seasons of the year. It is everywhere acknowledeed to be a powerful aid in restoring the body to a healthy state when deragv,ed by dis.age. If you suspect that your health is beginning to fail, brace up your nerves, and fortify your ccnAieution be taking no w a course of this excellent Tsnic, which is sold everywhere in battles at 23 9i and 4s 61 each, but should any difficulty be ex- perienced in procuring it, the Proprietors will forward same for the ab lye prices, carriage free. Avoid Imita- tions. When purchesingme the name,"G wilym Evans," en Label, Stamp, and Bottle. Sole Proprietors; Qtsinine Bitters Manufacturing Company, Limited, Llanelly, South Wales</p>
