      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-10-20_WidnesExaminer_art0090" n="art0090">
        <p>N view of the approaching Football beacon, it may be W- I terasting to state that the world-famed manuf icturers. Ciao. G. BUSSEY &amp; Co., of London. are preparing a stock of Batts. which for quality. uniformity, an i durability, will be unique. These b tils will be distinguished by the appearance thereon of their well known trade mark 4-Gaßfe. Ask the local Rp..irts Dealer for their Catalogue. If not procurable, apply to 36 38, Queen Victoria-street London Factories —Peckham, London; and IClmswell, duff )Ik.—Advt.</p>
        <p>* Secretaries of Football Clubs are requested to note that reports of matches played on Saturday must be sent to the Head Office, Bawsey-street. Warrington, nat later than 10 o'clock on Thursday morning or they cannot be inserted.</p>
