        <p>An Aggregate Prize of Lloo will be awarded the Competitor who scores the greatest number of points during the season (ending April). For example, a Competitor winning or sharing the prize will be credited with 4 points; the £25 prize 3 points; the .Z2O prize 2 points; and the o prize I point. 20 Coupons for SHILLING P. 0.; If in Stamps, 15 are required. EACH OF THE NUMBERS BELOW REPRESENTS A COUPON. 'Free]</p>
