      <div type="advertisement" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-10-20_WidnesExaminer_sect0001" n="sect0001">
        <p>}3ETER UOTTON. ROPE AND TWINE MANUFACTURER. Sacking, Canvas, Stack-corners Netting, Curled-hair, Oil Sheets, Ed., &amp;a. TENTS and MARQUEES for Sale or Hire. SPORTS, PICNICS, !cc., fitted complete. 6, CHESTER'S-YARD, WINWICK-STREET, WARRINGTON.</p>
